            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Plans, predictions and sequences: Your partner is deciding what to do after this account. Give a relevant suggestion, ask about one missing practical detail, and respond aloud to the possibility that their plan differs.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "下个星期我要去中国。今天我买书和衣服，先买书，然后买衣服。朋友说：“你现在就买吗？”\n\n我说：“明天要工作，明天没有时间。”朋友明白了。他也要去中国，下个星期和我去。\n\n下个星期，朋友说：“火车就要开了！”我们先上车，然后看书。书和衣服都在车上，我们没有回家。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
